+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: value of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvl5": direct, as the RPU gives them
+#: System/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#41893"
+msgid "Direct (as the RPU gives them)"
+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: value of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvl5": left aside, the area of the picture's place
+#: System/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#41894"
+msgid "Left aside (the picture's area)"
+msgstr ""
+
 
